+ * DSL values → Tailwind utility classes. Pure, no React.
+ *
+ * Every style the renderer draws is a Tailwind utility. A token becomes the
+ * theme key `@fanos/tokens` declares in its `@theme` block (`space.md` → `p-md`,
+ * `color.core_sec_500` → `text-core-sec-500`), so a tenant rethemes by changing
+ * the theme and never the tree. Anything else becomes an arbitrary value
+ * (`w-[182px]`, `aspect-[534/605]`), and a `Resp<>` becomes one class per
+ * breakpoint (`p-md md:p-lg`).
+ *
+ * The stylesheet is compiled from exactly the classes a render produced (see
+ * `css.ts`), so a class built here at runtime still gets its CSS.
+ */
